# rainforest.fbio — a terrain biome: what grows where it is painted, and the ground under it.
# The format is docs/guide/30-terrain.md's "Biome files"; the editor reloads this on save.
label: Temperate Rainforest
doc: 'A Hoh-valley rainforest floor: sword ferns and sorrel, huckleberry, salal and
  devil''s club, nurse logs, fallen branches and deep moss. Place its trees by hand.'
